<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Copa Artemis x Curi Gameplays - Moemon Ketzal</title>
    <!-- Fuentes de Google estilo Gaming & Serif elegante -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@600;700;800&family=Teko:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- MARCO METÁLICO HOLOGRÁFICO PRINCIPAL -->
    <div class="poster-frame">
        <div class="inner-border"></div>

        <!-- COLUMNA ELEMENTAL IZQUIERDA -->
        <aside class="element-sidebar left-sidebar">
            <div class="element-icon" title="Planta">🍃</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Fuego">🔥</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Agua">💧</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Eléctrico">⚡</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Psíquico">👁️</div>
        </aside>

        <!-- CONTENIDO CENTRAL DEL POSTER -->
        <main class="poster-content">

            <!-- ENCABEZADO / BÁNNER SUPERIOR -->
            <header class="header-banner">
                <div class="top-tag">COPA ARTEMIS</div>
                <h1 class="main-title">
                    CONCURSO ARTEMIS<br>
                    <span class="sub-title">x CURI GAMEPLAYS</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="subtitle-badge">ATRAPALOS A TODOS – CACERÍA DE POKEMON EN MOEMON KETZAL</p>
                <p class="description-text">
                    Participa en el primer gran torneo de captura de Pokémon Moemon. Una carrera épica para ver quién es el maestro absoluto. El primero en completar la Pokédex será el ganador y se llevará la gloria y un premio masivo.
                </p>
            </header>

            <!-- TARJETAS DE DESTACADOS Y PREMIOS -->
            <section class="highlights-container">
                <div class="highlight-card gold-border">
                    <span class="card-icon">🏆</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="card-label">PREMIO MAYOR</span>
                        <p class="card-value red-text">REGALOS EXCLUSIVOS</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="highlight-card">
                    <span class="tag-badge">MOÉMON KETZAL</span>
                    <p class="card-value font-bold">ÚNICO JUEGO OFICIAL</p>
                </div>

                <div class="highlight-card">
                    <div class="master-badge">1 <span>Master</span></div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="card-value font-bold">1 GANADOR ABSOLUTO</p>
                        <span class="card-sublabel">POKÉDEX COMPLETADA</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- BOTONES DE INFORMACIÓN E INSCRIPCIÓN -->
                <div class="action-row">
                    <button id="open-register-btn" class="action-btn glow-gold">
                        ¡INSCRÍBETE AHORA!<br>
                        <small>(Cupos Limitados)</small>
                    </button>
                    <a href="#reglamento" class="action-btn">
                        REGLAMENTO OFICIAL<br>
                        <small>(Ver. Ketzal Ver.)</small>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- DIVISOR SECCIÓN -->
            <div class="section-divider">
                <span>DETALLES DEL CONCURSO</span>
            </div>

            <!-- DETALLES EN 2 COLUMNAS -->
            <section class="details-grid">
                <!-- COLUMNA IZQUIERDA: FECHA Y LUGAR -->
                <div class="detail-card">
                    <div class="detail-group">
                        <span class="detail-title">📅 FECHA:</span>
                        <p class="detail-highlight">10-25 DE OCTUBRE, 2026</p>
                        <p class="detail-sub">Horario: 16:00 GMT-6 • 15 días de competición</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="detail-group">
                        <span class="detail-title">📍 LUGAR:</span>
                        <p class="detail-bold">SERVIDOR EXCLUSIVO MOEMON KETZAL</p>
                        <p class="detail-sub">Emisiones en vivo por Curi Gameplays y YouTube Gaming</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="game-footer-logo">
                        <div class="moemon-logo-text">MOÉMON <span>KETZAL</span></div>
                        <div class="starters">🌱 🔥 💧</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- COLUMNA DERECHA: INSCRIPCIONES Y CANAL -->
                <div class="detail-card">
                    <div class="detail-group">
                        <span class="detail-title">☆ INSCRIPCIONES:</span>
                        <p class="detail-highlight red-text">ABIERTAS</p>
                        <p class="detail-sub font-bold text-white">REGISTRO INDIVIDUAL ACTIVO</p>
                        <p class="detail-sub mt-1">Carrera individual de velocidad • Región Ketzal (completa) • Pokédex Galar Ampliada</p>
                    </div>

                    <p class="prize-text">🏆 Premios: Master Trophy + <strong>REGALOS EXCLUSIVOS</strong></p>

                    <div class="discord-section">
                        <p class="question-text">¿ERES UN MAESTRO POKEMON?</p>
                        <p class="sub-question">Únete al canal para seguimiento en vivo y soporte.</p>

                        <button id="open-register-btn-2" class="discord-join-btn">
                            <svg class="discord-icon" viewBox="0 0 127.14 96.36">
                                <path fill="currentColor" d="M107.7,8.07A105.15,105.15,0,0,0,81.47,0a72.06,72.06,0,0,0-3.36,6.83A97.68,97.68,0,0,0,49,6.83,72.37,72.37,0,0,0,45.64,0,105.89,105.89,0,0,0,19.39,8.09C2.79,32.65-1.71,56.6.54,80.21h0A105.73,105.73,0,0,0,32.71,96.36,77.7,77.7,0,0,0,39.6,85.25a68.42,68.42,0,0,1-10.85-5.18c.91-.66,1.8-1.34,2.66-2a75.57,75.57,0,0,0,64.32,0c.87.71,1.76,1.39,2.66,2a68.68,68.68,0,0,1-10.87,5.19,77,77,0,0,0,6.89,11.1,105.25,105.25,0,0,0,32.19-16.14c2.64-27.38-4.51-51.11-18.91-72.15ZM42.45,65.69C36.18,65.69,31,60,31,53s5-12.74,11.43-12.74S54,45.91,53.87,53,48.8,65.69,42.45,65.69Zm42.24,0C78.41,65.69,73.25,60,73.25,53s5-12.74,11.44-12.74S96.23,45.91,96.11,53,91.08,65.69,84.69,65.69Z"/>
                            </svg>
                            <span>UNIRSE AL CANAL DE CURI GAMEPLAYS</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- FOOTER LEGAL Y SITIO WEB -->
            <footer class="poster-footer">
                <p>©2026 CONCURSO ARTEMIS x CURI GAMEPLAYS • Todos los derechos reservados</p>
                <a href="https://www.caceria-ketzal-esports.com" target="_blank" class="website-link">WWW.CACERIA-KETZAL-ESPORTS.COM</a>
            </footer>

        </main>

        <!-- COLUMNA ELEMENTAL DERECHA -->
        <aside class="element-sidebar right-sidebar">
            <div class="element-icon" title="Lucha">👊</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Siniestro">🌙</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Acero">⚙️</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Volador">🦅</div>
            <div class="element-icon" title="Normal">🌟</div>
        </aside>

    </div>

    <!-- MODAL POP-UP DE INSCRIPCIÓN -->
    <div id="register-form-overlay" class="hidden" data-lenis-prevent>
        <form id="register-form">
            <h3>REGISTRO COPA ARTEMIS</h3>
            <p class="form-subtext">Cacería Pokémon Moemon Ketzal</p>
            
            <input type="text" id="nickname" placeholder="Nickname del Entrenador" required>
            <input type="email" id="contact-email" placeholder="Correo Electrónico de Contacto" required>
            <input type="text" id="discord-tag" placeholder="Usuario de Discord (Ej: Entrenador#1234)" required>

            <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Completar Registro</button>
            <button type="button" id="close-form" class="close-btn">Cancelar / Cerrar</button>
        </form>
    </div>

    <!-- SCRIPT WEBHOOK DISCORD + REDIRECCIÓN -->
    <script>
        const DISCORD_WEBHOOK_KETZAL = "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/1533123442508042431/JMG7CwgPM_E29BjcZrr4K13qQJNVWxA6Qaa9kcnXg_ybo_4jPhzkPnUAqctQMno5-9Xi";
        const DISCORD_INVITE_LINK = "https://discord.gg/EN4zwvT86f";

        const openRegisterBtn = document.getElementById('open-register-btn');
        const openRegisterBtn2 = document.getElementById('open-register-btn-2');
        const registerFormOverlay = document.getElementById('register-form-overlay');
        const closeFormBtn = document.getElementById('close-form');
        const registerForm = document.getElementById('register-form');

        const showModalForm = () => {
            registerFormOverlay?.classList.remove('hidden');
            if(typeof lenis !== 'undefined') lenis.stop();
        };

        const hideModalForm = () => {
            registerFormOverlay?.classList.add('hidden');
            if(typeof lenis !== 'undefined') lenis.start();
        };

        openRegisterBtn?.addEventListener('click', showModalForm);
        openRegisterBtn2?.addEventListener('click', showModalForm);

        closeFormBtn?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            e.stopPropagation();
            hideModalForm();
        });

        registerFormOverlay?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (e.target === registerFormOverlay) hideModalForm();
        });

        registerForm?.addEventListener('click', (e) => e.stopPropagation());

        registerForm?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();

            const nicknameInput = document.getElementById('nickname');
            const emailInput = document.getElementById('contact-email');
            const discordTagInput = document.getElementById('discord-tag');
            const submitBtn = registerForm.querySelector('.submit-btn');

            if (!nicknameInput || !emailInput || !discordTagInput) return;

            if (submitBtn) {
                submitBtn.disabled = true;
                submitBtn.textContent = 'Enviando Datos...';
            }

            const discordPayload = {
                username: "Copa Artemis Bot",
                embeds: [
                    {
                        title: "🏆 ¡NUEVA INSCRIPCIÓN - CACERÍA POKÉMON MOEMON!",
                        color: 0xE2A838, // Color Dorado
                        fields: [
                            {
                                name: "🎮 Nickname Entrenador",
                                value: `\`${nicknameInput.value}\``,
                                inline: true
                            },
                            {
                                name: "👾 Discord Tag",
                                value: `\`${discordTagInput.value}\``,
                                inline: true
                            },
                            {
                                name: "📧 Correo de Contacto",
                                value: emailInput.value,
                                inline: false
                            },
                            {
                                name: "🎮 Juego Oficial",
                                value: "Moémon Ketzal",
                                inline: true
                            }
                        ],
                        footer: {
                            text: "Concurso Artemis x Curi Gameplays • 2026"
                        },
                        timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
                    }
                ]
            };

            try {
                const response = await fetch(DISCORD_WEBHOOK_KETZAL, {
                    method: 'POST',
                    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                    body: JSON.stringify(discordPayload)
                });

                if (response.ok) {
                    alert(`¡Inscripción Registrada Con Éxito!\nBienvenido a la Copa Artemis. Te redirigiremos a nuestro canal oficial.`);
                    registerForm.reset();
                    hideModalForm();
                    window.open(DISCORD_INVITE_LINK, '_blank');
                } else {
                    alert('Error enviando la inscripción. Por favor intenta de nuevo.');
                }
            } catch (error) {
                console.error('Error enviando a Discord:', error);
                alert('Error de conexión al enviar los datos.');
            } finally {
                if (submitBtn) {
                    submitBtn.disabled = false;
                    submitBtn.textContent = 'Completar Registro';
                }
            }
        });
    </script>

    <!-- SCRIPT LENIS PARA SCROLL FLUIDO -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lenis@1.1.18/dist/lenis.min.js"></script>
    <script>
        const lenis = new Lenis({
            duration: 1.2,
            easing: (t) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t)),
            smoothWheel: true,
            smoothTouch: true,
        });

        function raf(time) {
            lenis.raf(time);
            requestAnimationFrame(raf);
        }

        requestAnimationFrame(raf);
    </script>
</body>
</html>

<!-- ESTILOS FIDELIDAD VISUAL AL AFICHE -->
<style>
    :root {
        --gold-primary: #e2a838;
        --gold-light: #fef08a;
        --red-accent: #ff3838;
        --dark-bg: #09090b;
        --card-bg: rgba(18, 18, 22, 0.95);
        --metal-border: #cbd5e1;
        --font-header: 'Cinzel', serif;
        --font-body: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
        --font-condensed: 'Teko', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        background-color: #030304;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 20px 10px;
    }

    /* CONTENEDOR PRINCIPAL TIPO MARCO METÁLICO */
    .poster-frame {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 520px;
        background: var(--dark-bg);
        border: 7px solid var(--metal-border);
        border-radius: 36px;
        box-shadow: 
            0 0 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),
            inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr 45px;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 10px 5px;
    }

    .inner-border {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 4px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(226, 168, 56, 0.4);
        border-radius: 28px;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    /* BARRAS LATERALES ELEMENTALES */
    .element-sidebar {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-around;
        align-items: center;
        z-index: 5;
        padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .element-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    /* CONTENIDO CENTRAL */
    .poster-content {
        z-index: 5;
        padding: 10px 5px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    .top-tag {
        font-family: var(--font-header);
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        font-weight: 900;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(226, 168, 56, 0.5);
    }

    .main-title {
        font-family: var(--font-header);
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .sub-title {
        color: #f1f5f9;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .subtitle-badge {
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin: 8px 0 6px;
    }

    .description-text {
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.3;
        max-width: 92%;
        margin: 0 auto 12px;
    }

    /* TARJETAS DESTACADAS */
    .highlights-container {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
    }

    .highlight-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 6px 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .gold-border {
        border-color: rgba(226, 168, 56, 0.6);
    }

    .card-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; }

    .card-label {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        font-weight: 800;
        display: block;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .card-value {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .red-text { color: var(--red-accent); }
    .font-bold { font-weight: 800; }

    .tag-badge {
        background: var(--gold-primary);
        color: #000;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .master-badge {
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--gold-primary);
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        line-height: 0.8;
    }
    .master-badge span { font-size: 0.4rem; }

    .card-sublabel {
        font-size: 0.55rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        display: block;
    }

    /* BOTONES */
    .action-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .action-btn {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 6px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .glow-gold {
        border-color: var(--gold-primary);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(226, 168, 56, 0.2);
    }

    .action-btn small {
        font-size: 0.55rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* SEPARADOR */
    .section-divider {
        margin: 12px 0 8px;
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .section-divider span {
        background: #000;
        border: 1px solid var(--gold-primary);
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        padding: 3px 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* DETALLES EN 2 COLUMNAS */
    .details-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 6px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .detail-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid rgba(226, 168, 56, 0.3);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 8px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .detail-title {
        color: var(--gold-primary);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        display: block;
    }

    .detail-highlight {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 900;
    }

    .detail-sub {
        font-size: 0.55rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .detail-bold {
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .game-footer-logo {
        margin-top: 8px;
        padding-top: 6px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .moemon-logo-text {
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: var(--gold-primary);
    }
    .moemon-logo-text span { color: #fff; }

    .starters { font-size: 0.75rem; }

    .prize-text {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        color: var(--gold-light);
        margin: 6px 0;
    }

    .discord-section {
        margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .question-text {
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .sub-question {
        font-size: 0.5rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .discord-join-btn {
        width: 100%;
        background: #4f46e5;
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        padding: 6px 4px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.55rem;
